{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Remediated plan-review finding f5a9bd80bef8352f3 before implementation: inserted a token-aware inline-Jira classifier ahead of pandoc for balanced bold, italic, link, color, and monospace spans; specified its conservative ambiguity/false-positive rule; and added Markdown-first five-pass idempotency oracles. Also fixed fallback telemetry to the content-free wiki_render_fallback event with pandoc_absent, conversion_failure, or preservation_failure reasons; clarified the Linux/macOS real-binary gate versus BSD fallback; named dynamic packaging/CI consumers; and required empirical pin/alternative evidence in ADR 0095. The worktree was fast-forwarded to current origin/main. No code or tests have been touched. The next review uses a process-local Sonnet override only; persistent frontier remains Bedrock Opus."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786573749468814001,"uuid":"da290eda-fffd-436c-9c56-0e6c85600344"}